*.db

# Built indexes and cached embeddings. Both are pure functions of the committed corpus and
# the pinned model, and both are large; `build` regenerates them in under a minute.
artifacts/*.bin
artifacts/*.npy
artifacts/*.json
!artifacts/.gitkeep
runs/

# 8 MB of templated prose, and a pure function of ragx/corpus.py plus a seed. The QRELS and a
# sha256 are committed instead: `ragx corpus --write` regenerates it, and CI fails if the hash
# moves, so the labels can never drift away from the corpus they were built against.
evals/corpus.jsonl

